description: Oxfords - polished, plain interfaces with no AI slop. Apply when building, changing or reviewing UI.
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.jsx", "**/*.vue", "**/*.svelte", "**/*.astro", "**/*.html", "**/*.css"]
alwaysApply: false
