Before writing or reviewing interface code, read `skills/oxfords/SKILL.md` and follow it:
work its Build order, read the reference file it names for this surface, generate every
colour with `node skills/oxfords/scripts/palette.mjs`, and fill its Done gate. Then run
`node skills/oxfords/scripts/check.mjs <path>` on the source and
`node skills/oxfords/scripts/shoot.mjs <page>` on the page, and look at the screenshots.

This project's own `DESIGN.md`, design system, tokens and brand rules take priority over Oxfords.
